        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur PARFON, Fontainebleau Knob With Parthenon Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nGrandeur's Crystal Fontainebleau Knob With Parthenon Plate makes a profound statement in luxury. The rich detailing of the Parthenon Plate combined with the classically designed crystal Fontainebleau Knob will enhance the elegance of your home in any of the lustrous finish choices. The Fontainebleau Knob is 24% lead crystal adding sparkle to the solid brass Parthenon Rose. It will fit doors 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\" thick with a 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backset. Available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nClick here to see the entire <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-decorative\"><b>Grandeur</b></a> - <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-parthenon-series\"><b>Parthenon Series</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur PARFON Crystal Fontainebleau Knob With Parthenon Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>The Parthenon Plate is made out of solid forged brass and the Fontainebleau Knob is 24% lead crystal.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Fontainebleau Knob With Parthenon Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Parthenon Plate Height: 7.84\"</li>\r\n<li>Parthenon Plate Width: 2.62\"</li>\r\n<li>Fontainebleau Knob Diameter: 2.30\"</li>\r\n<li>Fontainebleau Knob Projection: 2.32\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-PARFON-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262184\" target=\"new\"><b>Grandeur PARFON Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting A Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for one side of door. This inactive pull is usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for both sides of door. These inactive pulls are usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> Latches but does not lock. The latch is activated by turning the either of the two knobs.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> Latches and can be locked. Can be locked from the inside with a push-button.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Crystal Fontainebleau Knob With Parthenon Plate",
                "description": "Fontainebleau Knob With Parthenon Plate Grandeur PARFON - Grandeur's Crystal Fontainebleau Knob With Parthenon Plate makes a profound statement in luxury. The rich detailing of the Parthenon Plate combined with the classically designed crystal Fontainebleau Knob will enhance the elegance of your home in any of the lustrous finish choices. The Fontainebleau Knob is 24% lead crystal adding sparkle to the solid brass Parthenon Rose. It will fit doors 1-3/8 inches to 1-3/4 inches thick with a 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset. Available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions.",
